			"Message": "feat(Sky): Implement nine dormant Mountain event relays and update imports\n\nActivate nine Tauri event channels previously emitted by Mountain but ignored by Sky, resolving silent failures in tree views, configuration refreshes, extension lifecycle notifications, security incidents, status bar updates, terminal process IDs, and debug session hooks.\n\nThe `Source/Function/Sky/Bridge.ts` file now registers listeners for `sky://task/terminate`, `sky://tree-view/create`, `sky://configuration/changed`, `sky://extensions/installed/uninstalled`, `sky://security/incident`, `sky://statusbar/create`, `sky://terminal/processId`, and `sky://debug/start/register`. These handlers dispatch corresponding DOM events to the Workbench layer or invoke specific services (Configuration, Notification, Statusbar) to ensure UI surfaces update correctly. A task termination handler is also added to close task panes upon completion.\n\nConcurrently, update all import statements in `Source/Workbench` (Electron, Bundled, Mountain layouts) and `Source/Workbench/Electron/Polyfills.ts` to reflect the recent PascalCase directory migration, changing references from flat files like `SkyBridge` to `Sky/Bridge.js` and nested polyfill paths (e.g., `Process/Polyfill.js`).\n\nThis completes the integration audit of Mountain-to-Sky IPC, ensuring that backend state changes and extension triggers are faithfully propagated to the frontend workbench.",
			"SHA": "0c03d9059f19396adaff6b2296b1ed9c1e5bc479"
		},
